<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-11-14T14:22:18.977Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 14:22:18 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthis have intensified attacks on Saudi Arabia, striking the East West oil pipeline, a pumping station and launching missiles and drones that Saudi forces intercepted, with debris falling near Mecca, while the Saudi-led coalition reports destroying Houthi drones headed for Riyadh. In Yemen, Houthi shelling of a refugee camp in Lahj killed a Somali woman and attacks in Taiz killed 51 people and wounded 85, according to a rights group. Pakistan has urged an immediate end to Houthi attacks as the UN Security Council renews Yemen sanctions, and France’s foreign ministry spokesperson says France favours adding pressure on the Houthis. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxPcXIwbkFRM3dlZktvS0VBdHVLQURXY28xdmxYVnNnUUk3Sy1RRmd0dTNBeFhWS29TVVM1RVh3aGd5cmpObC1naWw4a25qTXRPOTRndFY0REw5UlY4d2tlR1dzMFNhbmlXc0NHSXMwWVpZcFZhOE1vQllfT3ZWZXU1X00wLWhiRnNPdmdnQnI4SUJrb0Q5eHRPRmlKYzg1akt0U0ZnM29LejY?oc=5&quot;&gt;NPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE5VWWVhRjlMVjR4M2ZBOEZ2MmphcFhXc2YyZGNIUnJXOV9uX1c0Sm8yNjFoS2owVVF0UE5ENy1UMDBpZnZjdTVUOA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Middle East Monitor&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxNa1pCYmpBZFlxRkxibHFvZDFWV05FZWtuaXQtOFp6VjdCQWx0ejV2VFdjQmkyZUd4MHU0S0FEaVctMnpnMzFoLUNVUmE2eDdlXy13WjJqSVZvOG1OSmJ6WDhoa0FycE5sbVdNSFM5c2VrbnJOQS1OZC03eXR1a3k3WG5MY2I5THpTWDZXMTZhQWpVLTBrMG1mM0hjbjBIRG1qaEx4TlByZjk1Q2hxVHY1T2RqX0NTbU9TbWtCNmpKRVd0OV84ajVaR3hR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Sun&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://ne